<title>USA: Galileo Electro-Optics to change name.</title>
<headline>Galileo Electro-Optics to change name.</headline>
<dateline>STURBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Electro-Optics Corp said Thursday its board of directors approved a change in the company's name to Galileo Corp, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company's stock symbol will remain.</p>
<p>Galileo develops, manufactures and markets fiberoptics and electro-optics components, assemblies and systems.</p>
